msgid "Rating source"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#32027"
msgid "Which audience ratings to keep up to date, and which one Kodi shows. \"Follow the scraper\" keeps the rating Kodi's scraper chose to show for each item and refreshes it when it comes from TMDB or IMDb; both are kept up to date, and the shown rating never changes source. The other options prefer or use only TMDB or IMDb, and make that rating the one Kodi shows (except for items with an NFO file, which decides that itself)."
msgstr ""

